{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:412eb9cee0f9e56fcf793e316f5f28bcac97cd50470972439be69ab143aeb51d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bcc4f84c0d28efdca7989db163b82b4c19e6ce6c15f4ed324a057afdbb611d4",
      "text": "A special surprise for you！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68e909a2b97ba9b4ba0bac53b7aa8f8c37140a8c1394769264b9e568c9113330",
      "text": "在某档综艺脱口秀节目中，\n薰和翼收到了为即将过生日的辉\n准备惊喜企划的邀请。\n一无所知迎来生日当天的辉，\n收到的VTR内容是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00bd5822996860d74952cffe1fd47a2df31697d65bcbfd656a3a240d7be29b44",
      "text": "刚从天道的老家当天往返，今天又要录制吗……\n从昨天开始就是高强度行程啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae64eec20d7de72e724594216ccaa40e57f9c8d9fa832484799900d5bb43314b",
      "text": "但是很开心不是吗。\n像短途旅行一样让人兴奋不已呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc29a8421b37b813fc8cdb5c33596c2d4598dbb007f844dc04a5c4fa21e62e05",
      "text": "重点在后面。还要做蛋糕。\n既然要做，就要做出完美的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b8012dd1371179459534d74b33cd07ae1aa273e987a0269b1c8a56c9a3a7da5",
      "text": "好的。为了让辉先生开心，\n做个超棒的蛋糕吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86c759e42832a962c9be45d03f0c643db813d1e57c051c2e54af23f1294a9b54",
      "text": "差不多该出发了。时间再多也不嫌多。\n去叫制作人吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efbf5b6e59590c27a190e535324a6a788a448e60454af4cf3f8ff2febbd4b01a",
      "text": "为了收集蛋糕的材料，\n特意跑去我老家了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e3674e8df45989353b6421dbe6534669e8d69c41531920ed643c034698f986b",
      "text": "是的！那是个非常棒的地方。\n空气和食物都很棒。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c974e4e74dc8cc1c9a81a4ef967eeceab4c068f8d04e18168fca2c2094a8ff9d",
      "text": "哈哈哈，你们做的\n蛋糕也最棒最好吃了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bd5c0873aa0241556ca613cd724b17306e1b6460e3d986dec9e236c4470a278",
      "text": "能让你开心就太好了。因为里面还倾注了辉先生\n老家农户们的声援呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e371337450ca5bd1455c46e7c9e9c25b628dd9092c3fac7b01e5ffcebbf3792",
      "text": "等DRAMATIC STARS去那边的时候，\n这次就由我来当向导吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37f31cf88fc7610f53f2df6765f8e55c5bd6cd32ddd992e6093d12e434a74a73",
      "text": "没想到你居然会为了我做那种事啊。\n真是做梦都没想到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1d614f30bcf991bca6bf33eccd15b62368e925c60e2a6ee8db543b2b2877119",
      "text": "你好像误会了什么，\n我可不是为了你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c4a69ffeaff919b5c43dd5c2071a34d7edf84d655230f6e5c36a57c9a79025d",
      "text": "我只是判断为了炒热节目气氛有必要这么做，\n才去做的罢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:284a9fbfab9e10fd0b5ca57afbb093554f98bd046893d1ea24776ee17bbb85c7",
      "text": "知道啦知道啦。\n即便如此我也很高兴哦。谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_12:1_2_004_12_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a304fae117b25e99cdbb72628cf501bf993ba25be2de87e7135f1f4a6fc1263",
      "text": "所以说，\n明年我也好好期待着哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
